{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>Six days you shall labor and on the seventh day you shall rest.</b> Your success when you labor six days will be as it is when you rest on the seventh." "<b>In plowing and in harvest you shall rest.</b> And likewise when you rest once every seven years in plowing and in harvest — the sabbatical years, which are also called a sabbath to HaShem — you will succeed in plowing and in harvest, as it says (Exodus 23:10): וְשֵׁשׁ שָׁנִים תִּזְרַע אֶת אַרְצֶךָ וְאָסַפְתָּ אֶת תְּבוּאָתָהּ."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 34, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:28:08.849150190Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}